1295
00:58:08,070 --> 00:58:13,070
who's been hit with a fish.

1296
00:58:13,275 --> 00:58:16,529
- I will destroy your powers.

1297
00:58:16,529 --> 00:58:19,693
- Oh, no, he, wo--oh, ho,
lookout, oh, Mrs. English lady!

1298
00:58:19,693 --> 00:58:23,457
I'm trying to fly, go
backwards, okay, okay,

1299
00:58:23,457 --> 00:58:28,012
woah-ho-ho, god, woah!

1300
00:58:28,012 --> 00:58:31,841
