1301
00:58:31,841 --> 00:58:36,841
- I will bunch up your package
so it's very uncomfortable.

1302
00:58:38,966 --> 00:58:43,914
- I got a new jacket.

1303
00:58:43,914 --> 00:58:45,440
- You belong to me now.

1304
00:58:45,440 --> 00:58:50,440
- I have the title to your head.

1305
00:58:50,603 --> 00:58:53,428
- You cannot escape me!

1306
00:58:53,428 --> 00:58:58,428
- There go my keys, my
wallet, and my camera.

1307
00:58:59,167 --> 00:59:02,559
- You can no longer jump into space.

1308
00:59:02,559 --> 00:59:07,559
- Look out below, half digested
fish and chips coming down.

1309
00:59:08,202 --> 00:59:10,547
- Okay, okay, I got it.

1310
00:59:10,547 --> 00:59:15,547
- (Tom makes noises)

1311
00:59:16,137 --> 00:59:17,971
- Because you are made of earth!

1312
00:59:17,971 --> 00:59:19,369
- Corn grows in you.

1313
00:59:19,369 --> 00:59:21,832
- And to earth you shall return.

1314
00:59:21,832 --> 00:59:26,832
- That's kind of an odd
thing to say, even for him.

1315
00:59:29,309 --> 00:59:31,581
- And there goes the 25
million dollar restoration

1316
00:59:31,581 --> 00:59:36,076
